      "description": "Watch AZ Alkmaar vs GO Ahead Eagles highlights and goals from Eredivisie on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 29, 2026. High-scoring encounter lights up the Eredivisie The anticipation around the stadium was clear as the players emerged for a fixture that promised tactical battles and individual brilliance on August 29, 2026. With the competitive nature of the Eredivisie in full display, both sides looked ready to push their limits in front of a passionate home crowd. First half fireworks AZ Alkmaar drew first blood with a spectacular strike from distance by Dave Kwakman in the 7th minute. The visitors, Go Ahead Eagles , remained composed and found their rhythm to level the score through Victor Edvardsen in the 22nd minute. The momentum swung back to the hosts just before halftime, as Ro-Zangelo Daal fired in a clinical right-footed shot from outside the box to regain the lead. Second half dominance The hosts maintained their intensity after the restart, with Lewis Schouten doubling the advantage in the 49th minute following smart work from Mateo Chavez . Chavez himself then capitalized on a defensive blunder to net the fourth goal in the 68th minute, effectively putting the game out of reach. The attacking display was capped off in the 86th minute when Ro-Zangelo Daal scored his second, assisted by Calvin Stengs . In the final moments of stoppage time, Mathis Suray managed to pull one back for the Go Ahead Eagles to make it 5-2. Despite the late effort, it was a dominant performance for AZ Alkmaar in front of 18,213 fans."
